  'An eight-week structured programme to become a Level 1 Certified Therapist with supervised floor practice.', 'This programme builds safe, consistent skin and hair therapy skills in the VTIARA way. You will learn the science, consultation and documentation, then practise facials, skin treatments, scalp care and device handling under direct supervision, finishing with practical stations and a completed logbook.', 'Aspiring and existing skin therapists, and cosmetology or aesthetics trainees joining VTIARA.', array['Common Core Training completed (recommended before starting)','Minimum Class 12 or equivalent','Comfort working with patients in a clinical setting']::text[], array['Apply skin and hair science to safe therapy decisions within scope','Conduct structured consultations and complete accurate documentation','Perform facials, skin treatments and scalp care to VTIARA standard under supervision','Operate devices with laser-safety precautions','Explain products and aftercare without prescribing','Demonstrate consistent practice through a supervised logbook']::text[], array['100% attendance','80% or higher knowledge score','All practical stations passed','Completed logbook','Trainer approval before certificate issue']::text[], '{"attendance_pct":100,"knowledge_pct":80,"practical":"All practical stations passed","logbook":true}'::jsonb) on conflict (id) do nothing;

